   "parent": 1352142644,
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I see. My {D} has a way of pulling people into his web. And my {M}... well, let’s just say she’s not exactly a nurturing influence. I don’t envy you.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
